ghYear:1955,category:"bar",categoryZh:"酒吧",dateLabel:"c. 1935–1955",note:"Early bar period recalled by Neil Yee; exact opening unverified.",noteZh:"Neil Yee 转述的早期酒吧时期，确切开业日未证实。",sourceKeys:["gold-history"],approximate:true},{name:"Gold Dollar",nameZh:"Gold Dollar",fromYear:1956,throughYear:1988,category:"gay / drag-show bar",categoryZh:"同性恋／变装表演酒吧",dateLabel:"c. 1956–1988/89",note:"Period reported retrospectively by Neil Yee. A 1963 newspaper independently describes female impersonators.",noteZh:"时段来自 Neil Yee 的回顾；1963 年同期报纸另有变装表演记载。",sourceKeys:["gold-history","gold-1963","gold-pride"],approximate:true},{name:"Gold Dollar → Cartell’s Lounge",nameZh:"Gold Dollar → Cartell’s Lounge",fromYear:1989,throughYear:1990,category:"bar · name transition",categoryZh:"酒吧·改名阶段",dateLabel:"c. 1989–1990",note:"Cartell’s operated for about one year after Gold Dollar. Boundary years uncertain.",noteZh:"Gold Dollar 之后曾改名 Cartell’s，约一年；交接年份尚不精确。",sourceKeys:["gold-history"],approximate:true},{name:"Former Cartell’s Lounge",nameZh:"原 Cartell’s Lounge",fromYear:1991,throughYear:1993,category:"closed premises",categoryZh:"停业建筑",dateLabel:"early 1990s",note:"Closure followed Cartell’s; exact dates unknown.",noteZh:"Cartell’s 之后关闭，起止日期未明。",sourceKeys:["gold-history"],approximate:true},{name:"Gold Dollar · Neil Yee",nameZh:"Gold Dollar · Neil Yee",fromYear:1994,throughYear:1995,category:"acquisition / preparation",categoryZh:"接手／筹备",dateLabel:"late 1994 / early 1995",note:"Neil Yee recalled taking over in late 1994 or early 1995.",noteZh:"Neil Yee 回忆在 1994 年底或 1995 年初接手。",sourceKeys:["gold-history"],approximate:true},{name:"Gold Dollar",nameZh:"Gold Dollar",fromYear:1996,throughYear:2e3,category:"live music venue",categoryZh:"现场音乐场所",dateLabel:"1996–18 Aug 2001",note:"Reopened by Neil Yee in 1996; final performance on 18 August 2001.",noteZh:"Neil Yee 于 1996 年重新开业；最后一场演出为 2001 年 8 月 18 日。",sourceKeys:["gold-history","gold-close"]},{name:"Gold Dollar · closed",nameZh:"Gold Dollar · 已关闭",from